{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_14","type":"agent_message","text":"The code tags storage-append completion with the current Raft term as well as the entry’s term and index. The consumer ignores stale-term entry stabilization but still processes an attached snapshot. I’ll retain this producer/consumer relationship in a partial map; quorum aggregation, recovery, and configuration paths still need reading before the core overview is usable.\n"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_15","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat > build_submission.py <<'PY'\nimport json\nsources=[]\ndef src(i,f,a,b,k='code_observation'):\n sources.append(dict(id=i,file=f,start_line=a,end_line=b,kind=k));return i\nsrc('S_raw_entry','rawnode.go',24,210)\nsrc('S_ready_contract','node.go',49,187,'interface_statement')\nsrc('S_append_messages','rawnode.go',212,399)\nsrc('S_send','raft.go',512,599)\nsrc('S_reset_append','raft.go',778,847)\nsrc('S_roles','raft.go',891,971)\nsrc('S_step','raft.go',1085,1263)\nbehaviors=[dict(id='B_append_response_packaging',primary_activity='A6',execution_owner='RawNode.readyWithoutAccept and newStorageAppendMsg/newStorageAppendRespMsg, serialized by the RawNode caller',protocol_context='AsyncStorageWrites enabled; Ready includes outstanding or in-progress unstable entries, hard-state updates, snapshots, or responses waiting for append completion.',trigger='Ready generation creates local append work and attached response messages.',reads=['raft.msgsAfterAppend','raft.Term','raftLog.lastEntryID and hasNextOrInProgressUnstableEnts','Ready HardState, Entries and Snapshot'],writes=['MsgStorageAppend.Responses with deferred protocol replies and a local MsgStorageAppendResp'],produces_fact_ids=['F_append_completion_descriptor'],async_boundaries=['The embedding application must process local append work before delivering its attached responses; creation of the message itself does not perform storage IO.'],cross_activity_effects={'A1':'Wraps MsgAppResp, including leader self-acknowledgments, behind the append completion boundary.','A2':'Wraps vote/pre-vote responses behind append completion and records the current term in the local stabilization response.'},source_ids=['S_raw_entry','S_append_messages','S_send'],unknowns=['Local append thread ordering contract in Config and in-repository embedding implementations has not yet been read.']),dict(id='B_step_context_and_storage',primary_activity='A2',execution_owner='raft.Step called by RawNode.Step or internal methods; RawNode requires caller serialization',protocol_context='Message term relative to current raft.Term; local storage responses enter the same term dispatch.',trigger='Incoming protocol or local completion message.',implementation_guards=['RawNode.Step rejects unexpected local message senders and responses from unknown nonlocal peers.','Step handles higher-term messages before per-state dispatch, except pre-vote and active-lease exceptions.','Lower-term MsgStorageAppendResp never calls stableTo for its entry index.'],reads=['Message Term, Type, Index, LogTerm, Snapshot','Current Term, Vote, lead, checkQuorum and electionElapsed'],writes=['On accepted storage append response, calls raftLog.stableTo using entry LogTerm and Index.','For attached snapshots calls appliedSnap even on the lower-term branch.','For storage apply completion uses final entry index and size through appliedTo.'],consumes_fact_ids=['F_append_completion_descriptor'],important_branches=['Term-zero messages bypass term comparisons.','Higher-term ordinary messages cause becomeFollower; stale ordinary messages return without state-specific handling.','Vote eligibility combines prior vote/leader context with log freshness; real votes update Vote, pre-votes do not.'],cross_activity_effects={'A6':'Current-term append completion may retire unstable entries; stale-term completion cannot do so through Step.','A5':'Application responses use a term-independent path; stale snapshot completion is explicitly preserved.'},source_ids=['S_raw_entry','S_step'],unknowns=['stableTo identity checks and appliedSnap implementation remain unread.','Full producer legality and ordered storage completion must be traced before constructing a formal witness.']),dict(id='B_role_reset',primary_activity='A2',execution_owner='raft role transition helpers',protocol_context='Follower, candidate, pre-candidate and leader state transitions.',trigger='becomeFollower, becomeCandidate, becomePreCandidate or becomeLeader.',writes=['reset changes Term and clears Vote only on term change; clears leader, transfer, votes, pendingConfIndex, readOnly and uncommittedSize.','reset reconstructs progress with remote Match zero and local Match at lastIndex.','becomeCandidate increments term and records self vote.','becomePreCandidate resets votes without increasing term or changing Vote.','becomeLeader enters replicate mode for itself and appends an empty entry, whose self-ack is deferred by send.'],cross_activity_effects={'A1':'Rebuilds replication support for a new role and appends a current-term empty entry on leadership acquisition.','A6':'appendEntry queues its self-ack in msgsAfterAppend rather than immediately advancing local replication progress.'},source_ids=['S_reset_append','S_roles','S_send'],unknowns=['Campaign vote tally and leader replication response aggregation are not yet traced.','Old pending read-index messages need inspection beyond readOnly reset.'])]\nfact=dict(id='F_append_completion_descriptor',meaning='A generated local append response identifies the node term at packaging time and, when unstable entries exist, their last entry index and entry term. It is a descriptor of completion owed by the application, not an observation that IO has occurred.',identity={'node':'MsgStorageAppendResp.To','completion_context':'MsgStorageAppendResp.Term','entry':'MsgStorageAppendResp.Index and LogTerm'},validity_context='Produced for asynchronous local append processing. The documented response contract covers this Ready and all prior Ready storage work. Step only uses its entry stabilization component when its nonzero message term survives term filtering.',representation=['pb.Message Type MsgStorageAppendResp, From LocalAppendThread, To r.id, Term r.Term','Index and LogTerm populated whenever hasNextOrInProgressUnstableEnts is true','Optional Snapshot pointer'],durability='Message construction is volatile; the caller owes completion of durable storage before delivering the response. No executed storage observation is claimed.',recovery='Restart reconstruction has not been read; this fact describes only the live response path.',source_ids=['S_append_messages','S_step'],unknowns=['Exact storage worker ordering and unstable.stableTo checks remain to be read.'])\ncore_gaps=['Trace leader MsgProp admission, follower append validation, leader response aggregation, joint quorum calculation and log commit guard through actual implementations.','Trace election initiation and vote tally, timers and leader transfer to establish acquisition/loss conditions.','Read configuration application, snapshot restore, storage reconstruction and application progress so old decisions and work are accounted for.','Read Node serialization and Ready acceptance/Advance, together with Config async storage ordering duties.']\nmapdata=dict(version=1,target_profile=dict(system_boundary='Captured go.etcd.io/raft implementation. RawNode is thread-unsafe and delegates stable storage, message transport and state-machine application through Ready. Node exposes a channel API whose loop is not yet read.',protocol_contexts=['Per-node term, vote, role, leader, log and replication tracker'],external_interfaces=['RawNode.Propose, Campaign, Step, Ready, ApplyConfChange','Node.Ready/Advance and proposal retry contract'],ownership=['RawNode caller serializes calls and performs storage/network/application work.','raft owns protocol state and local completion interpretation.'],variants=['Synchronous Ready/Advance','AsyncStorageWrites local append/apply messages'],source_ids=['S_raw_entry','S_ready_contract','S_step'],unknowns=core_gaps),behaviors=behaviors,facts=[fact],surfaces=[dict(entry_point='raft.maybeCommit',disposition='deferred',reason='Calls raftLog.maybeCommit with current term and tracker.Committed. Both callees and the support aggregation caller remain unread.',source_ids=['S_reset_append'],high_consequence=True),dict(entry_point='RawNode.ApplyConfChange / Node.ApplyConfChange',disposition='deferred',reason='Application applies committed configuration changes and records returned ConfState in snapshots. In-repository configuration implementation remains unread, not externalized.',source_ids=['S_raw_entry','S_ready_contract'],high_consequence=True),dict(entry_point='RawNode.Ready / Node.Advance',disposition='deferred',reason='Ready constructs append/apply work; acceptReady and Advance execution and Node serialization loop remain unread.',source_ids=['S_raw_entry','S_ready_contract'],high_consequence=True)],core_overview=dict(status='incomplete',formation=dict(explanation='RawNode.Propose enters raft.Step with MsgProp. The read appendEntry helper stamps entries with current term and consecutive indexes, appends them and sends a deferred self MsgAppResp. maybeCommit asks the tracker for a committed index and passes it with current term to the log. Ready exposes storage, messages and committed application work; Node.Propose explicitly permits dropped proposals and assigns retry responsibility to the caller. Admission, remote support aggregation and downstream log validation are gaps, not inferred guarantees.',behavior_ids=['B_role_reset','B_append_response_packaging'],source_ids=['S_raw_entry','S_ready_contract','S_reset_append','S_send']),context=dict(explanation='Step compares message and node terms before dispatch, with explicit pre-vote and lease exceptions. Role transitions reset vote/progress/read context differently: candidacy raises term, pre-candidacy does not, and leadership appends an empty entry. Stale ordinary messages return without state-specific dispatch. Full election tally, transfer and timers remain unread.',behavior_ids=['B_step_context_and_storage','B_role_reset'],source_ids=['S_step','S_roles','S_reset_append']),connection=dict(explanation='Support emission waits behind storage completion via msgsAfterAppend, while append stabilization carries both the current protocol term and the last entry identity. Step excludes stale-term entry stabilization but still consumes snapshot completion on that branch. Apply completion messages carry zero term because their entries are already committed. This observed split connects authority changes to pending persistence and application work, but does not yet establish complete history safety.',behavior_ids=['B_append_response_packaging','B_step_context_and_storage'],fact_ids=['F_append_completion_descriptor'],source_ids=['S_send','S_append_messages','S_step']),open_details=['Lease-based versus safe ReadIndex behavior and ForgetLeader implications.'],core_gaps=core_gaps,rationale='Initial sourced partial map. Both core lines have concrete anchors but unread formation, transition and recovery responsibilities prevent usable status.'))\njson.dump(mapdata,open('initial-map.json','w'),indent=2)\nsubmission=dict(action='research',rationale='Retain the initial source-grounded storage/context relationship and precise backbone gaps before extending the core overview.',sources=sources,map_path='initial-map.json',feedback=dict(ref_ids=[x['id'] for x in sources],answered='RawNode entry and Ready contracts distinguish proposal submission from commitment and IO completion. send defers append and vote responses; local append completion packages protocol term separately from entry identity. Step rejects stale-term entry stabilization while preserving attached snapshot completion. These are source observations, not execution evidence.',remaining=core_gaps,understanding='updated',rationale='Next read the formation chain from stepLeader/stepFollower through tracker quorum and raftLog, then election tally/configuration/recovery. This establishes the missing ownership and history premises before choosing a focused Candidate; the storage response asymmetry is retained as a lead, not a defect.'))\njson.dump(submission,open('submission.json','w'),indent=2)\nPY\npython3 build_submission.py\n/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/.venv/bin/python -I -B -c \\\"import sys; sys.path.insert(0, '/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/src'); from consensus_assurance.cli import main; raise SystemExit(main())\\\" validate --run /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/runs/2026-10-02_19-39-39-etcd_raft-real-run --submission submission.json\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
